OAB - Transformer-based open-source speech recognition software did not outperform 
      leading commercial speech recognition software in the transcription of radiology 
      reports. This result likely reflects highly specific verbiage in 
      radiology-related text, which is distinct from the general-context Internet audio 
      used to train the transformer-based software. Nonetheless, the tool provides an 
      accessible foundation for developing large language model–powered speech 
      recognition platforms.
